            <div class="step3-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Sense of Significance</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/sun-glow.png" style="filter:none">                
                <p>Attaining a sense of significance is a vital need for everybody.  If we don’t figure out a way to feel significant we can start to become stagnant, we might develop poor confidence, and our wellbeing begins to deplete.  Most people however, naturally figure out a way to develop their sense of significance, and in the case of The Creator Archetype, they attain their significance through inspiring and leading the world into to new and unique territory.</p>
                <p><strong>Creators Love To Inspire And Influence Others</strong></p>
                <p>If others identify the Creators work or creative output as groundbreaking or inspirational the Creator will be delighted and will feel a great sense of significance.</p> 
                <p>And if a Creator can start a trend or make something ‘go viral’ then they are in their element.</p>
                <p>Creators love to inspire and influence others because it’s incredibly important for the Creator to inspire or improve their lives, or the lives of others through creativity.  It’s also one of the ways that a Creator attains their sense of significance. </p>
                <p><strong>The Unique Challenges That A Creator Archetype Will Face When Attaining Significance.</strong></p>
                <p>Unfortunately, the Creators destructive nature, (which will almost always kick in if they are dissatisfied with their efforts) can cause a lack of confidence and esteem because they won’t feel a sense of valid contribution or significance.</p>
                <p>Some Creators cannot find a way to express their creativity which will lead them to turn inwards and be extremely hard on themselves too.</p>
                <p>The threat of a sense of lack when it comes to significance is a damaging situation for any Archetype, but the Creator is one of the Archetypes who face the greatest challenge in attaining a sense of relevance.  This threat is due to their sense of perfectionism and insatiable drive to be unique and innovative.</p>
                <p>As such, Creators often hide their feelings or try to express their emotions through their projects as a way to achieve this sense of innovation and individuality.</p>
                <p>There’s more on this further on in this report.</p>
                <p><strong>Creators Need To Feel A Sense Of Pride</strong></p>
                <p>While the notion of feeling a sense of pride may be perceived by others to be the same as the Creators need to influence and inspire.  It won’t be the same to the Creator. </p>
                <p>Pride and the act of inspiring are two different things. </p>
                <p>Even though a Creator will attain a sense of pride if they inspire somebody, it doesn’t mean that they feel a sense of pride in the work that they did to inspire.  If the Creator is not completely satisfied with their work and they haven’t worked on balancing their need for perfection, it will still be quite the challenge to the Creator to feel proud of what they have created.</p>
                <p>It is vitally important for the Creator to realize this and work to balance it so that they stay confident in themselves.</p>
                <p>Because the Creator absorbs themselves into their creative projects often at the cost of something else in their life, there will always be some aspect of the Creators life that needs revamping or perfecting from the Creators perspective.</p>
                <p>Which means that even if the Creator inspires others, and is proud of their work, they won’t integrate that sense of significance wholly because there is probably going to be another aspect of the Creator's life that is less than perfect and causing the Creator to feel insignificant in some way.</p>
