            <div class="step4-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?>'s Personality Traits</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/floral.png">
                <p><strong>Why Do We Hide Ourselves Even From Ourselves?</strong></p>
                <p>Every person has a hidden side, Jung calls it the Shadow, and it’s discussed in great detail, concerning your dominant archetype in the premium reports. There is a hidden side or an unconscious world (to be more precise) that we experience internally, but we don’t, or can't show or express this existence outwardly.  </p>
                <p>When we start to uncover these aspects of our ‘self,’ we begin to learn about what really druves us.  We begin to discover the reasons why we do the things we do (or don’t do the things that we want to do, or should do). And we can start to consciously reconcile these hidden aspects so that we can achieve our deepest desires, or reach our full potential.  </p>
                <p>In the case of The Creator, their hidden personality traits often lie in understanding the reasons why pride and innovation is so crucial for them.  So that they can learn what is driving them. And then when they can understand the hidden aspects of their ‘self’ that have a significant influence on them, they can learn how reconcile these problems so that they can take a more balanced outlook on their life.</p>
                <p>Most driving factors for a Creator will originate from deep and limiting beliefs that are pushing their ideas forward into your life and have a huge influence on the way that you think.  Essentially what they are doing is bringing the lack of balance to your attention so that you can realize that there is something wrong and correct that.</p>
                <p>In doing so, it doesn’t mean that you will lose your gifts of expression and creativity but more so that you’ll probably unlock your potential and either improve all aspects of your life easily, enhance your projects or even start to find your unique way to contribute to the world.</p>
                <p>Check out The Premium Archetype report to learn more about your Shadow Self and how to get started on the journey to individuation. </p>
